s home city to crush them once and for all.\nThe once Golden Age of Cybertron is over.\nThese are the end of days...", "summary": "Transformers: Fall of Cybertron transports you to the final days of the planet Cybertron where you will experience the darkest hours of the apocalyptic war between the Autobots and Decepticons.\n\nEmbark on an adrenaline-fueled journey through a wide range of missions and massive environments designed around each character's unique abilities. Fight through both sides of the most epic battles leading to their legendary exodus from their homeworld. In addition, players experience action in the form of new Transformer bot types Combaticons, Insecticons, and Dinobots.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/transformers-fall-of-cybertron", "videos": [{"id": 4904, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "eyW5KMMDjZw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eyW5KMMDjZw", "title": "E3 Trailer -- Official Transformers: Fall of Cybertron Video", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/eyW5KMMDjZw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 83798, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "8ODWWwvbV-0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8ODWWwvbV-0", "title": "LAUNCH Trailer - Official Fall of Cybertron Game Video - Available NOW", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8ODWWwvbV-0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 83797, "name": "Dev Diary", "video_id": "EcY2NUPtqZw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EcY2NUPtqZw", "title": "Multiplayer Behind The Scenes - Transformers Fall of Cybertron Official Video", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EcY2NUPtqZw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 141710, "name": "VGA 2011 Trailer", "video_id": "nlmgLYuPwRw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nlmgLYuPwRw", "title": "Transformers: Fall Of Cybertron - VGA 2011", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nlmgLYuPwRw/maxresdefault.jpg"}], "collections": [{"id": 8564, "name": "Transformers: War for Cybertron"}, {"id": 3197, "name": "Tr